 ## Operating characteristics
-- Time complexity: $O(N)$ where $N$ is the number of voxels in the chunk, as each voxel is processed once with a constant number of neighbor checks [S2, unofficial].
-- Memory complexity: $O(N)$ for the `visibilityMap` array, where each voxel stores a `VoxelFace` bitmask [S2, unofficial].
