 ## Background
-- Origin: The method is part of the VoxelMeshOptimizerLibrary, a .NET 8 library for voxel mesh optimization [S2, unofficial].
-- History and development: The library includes features such as occlusion culling, disjoint-set quad merging, and an OBJ exporter [S2, unofficial]. It targets engine-agnostic use and includes a benchmark suite [S2, unofficial].
-- Where it is used: In voxel meshing pipelines that require efficient culling of non-visible voxel faces [S2, unofficial].
